{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>\u201cRoguelite board game with arty medieval swagger.\u201d</strong></i><strong>\u00a0- Rogueliker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/d278cca85b284a463cc237047b8cce41.poster.avif?t=1757200075\" width=494 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/d278cca85b284a463cc237047b8cce41.webm?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/d278cca85b284a463cc237047b8cce41.mp4?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ooh, hex tiles! Is that one those board games?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well\u2026 yes, sort of. You pick a building and place it at the intersection of tiles. <strong>Roll the dice</strong> and watch the harvest. But that\u2019s just the beginning\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/3f66bad9fb83b4f57a50bd53c659c65a.poster.avif?t=1757200075\" width=498 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/3f66bad9fb83b4f57a50bd53c659c65a.webm?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/3f66bad9fb83b4f57a50bd53c659c65a.mp4?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dragon Fodder</i> is a zesty roguelite stew of board game mechanics, broken combos, and <strong>numbers going through the roof</strong>. Balance your board between resource production, earning ducats, and cooking up flavor for your meals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build harbors to add more dice to your tray and expand your shops. Create shrines that boost adjacent buildings and tiles. Find <strong>overpowered synergies</strong> and stack bonuses. Buy and use tools to improve your board, change and boost tiles, and fix your dice. Choose from a wide selection of recipes that change the way you play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to make English food? Go ahead\u2026 just don\u2019t add any spice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a die with six sixes? Let me grab my chisel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to pet the dragon? Oh, you can do that too. Just watch out when the <i>hanger</i> strikes\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dragon Fodder</i> draws inspiration from Balatro, as the <strong>fodder x flavor</strong> scoring mechanic should feel very familiar to fans of that delightfully addictive card game. Wrapped in lovely hand-drawn art style, <i>Dragon Fodder</i> hopes to give you that shot of dopamine you crave so much. Also, there might be a co-op mode in the works\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/a56c131aef208e671dbba2680e6686f3.poster.avif?t=1757200075\" width=710 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/a56c131aef208e671dbba2680e6686f3.webm?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/a56c131aef208e671dbba2680e6686f3.mp4?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s what\u2019s on the menu:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hex tiles</strong> - familiar to all board game fans, but without real-world limitations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+ unique recipes</strong> - each one changes how the game is played</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ buildings</strong> - place, upgrade, and combine for absurd resource engines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ dice types</strong> - odd, even, colored... and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fix everything</strong> - tinker with dice, recipes, buildings, even the board itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple dragon variants</strong> - each more ravenous than the last</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied game modes</strong> - customize your challenge and starting conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode</strong> - wait, co-op in a roguelite?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/df449f8115b3cd2e502a0522a5bd65a4.poster.avif?t=1757200075\" width=306 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/df449f8115b3cd2e502a0522a5bd65a4.webm?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/df449f8115b3cd2e502a0522a5bd65a4.mp4?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966510?t=1757200075","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/e4aaf50ced0066a48b282dc56413e7fd9e836152/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757200075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/1b59b148c3d9eca646cb6961c9f3ac8e790356cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757200075","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/1b59b148c3d9eca646cb6961c9f3ac8e790356cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757200075","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>\u201cRoguelite board game with arty medieval swagger.\u201d</strong></i><strong>\u00a0- Rogueliker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/d278cca85b284a463cc237047b8cce41.poster.avif?t=1757200075\" width=494 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/d278cca85b284a463cc237047b8cce41.webm?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/d278cca85b284a463cc237047b8cce41.mp4?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_parag