er</i> strikes\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dragon Fodder</i> draws inspiration from Balatro, as the <strong>fodder x flavor</strong> scoring mechanic should feel very familiar to fans of that delightfully addictive card game. Wrapped in lovely hand-drawn art style, <i>Dragon Fodder</i> hopes to give you that shot of dopamine you crave so much. Also, there might be a co-op mode in the works\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/a56c131aef208e671dbba2680e6686f3.poster.avif?t=1757200075\" width=710 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/a56c131aef208e671dbba2680e6686f3.webm?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/a56c131aef208e671dbba2680e6686f3.mp4?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s what\u2019s on the menu:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hex tiles</strong> - familiar to all board game fans, but without real-world limitations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+ unique recipes</strong> - each one changes how the game is played</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ buildings</strong> - place, upgrade, and combine for absurd resource engines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ dice types</strong> - odd, even, colored... and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fix everything</strong> - tinker with dice, recipes, buildings, even the board itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple dragon variants</strong> - each more ravenous than the last</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied game modes</strong> - customize your challenge and starting conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode</strong> - wait, co-op in a roguelite?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/df449f8115b3cd2e502a0522a5bd65a4.poster.avif?t=1757200075\" width=306 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/df449f8115b3cd2e502a0522a5bd65a4.webm?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/extras/df449f8115b3cd2e502a0522a5bd65a4.mp4?t=1757200075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Moravian"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966510/6f2952002327cbe08382522f95c0154f0e4015fc/header.jpg?t=1757200075","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257188046,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188046/movie480.mp4?t=1756722782","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188046/movie_max.mp4?t=1756722782"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188046/40cc04c4cce7ec31e5e80c749a434ca017143d6b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756722782","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188046/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756722782","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188046/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756722782"}}],"name":"Dragon Fodder","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Mi